  <comment>Key: Id (int) is declared on the SeedWork Entity base class, so it isn't modelled here. Id uses the HiLo sequence paymentseq. Its persisted card data is held in private fields that the model can't describe: _alias (column Alias, max 200, required), _cardNumber (CardNumber, max 25, required), _cardHolderName (CardHolderName, max 200, required), _expiration (Expiration) and _cardTypeId (CardTypeId, the foreign key to CardType). _securityNumber isn't mapped. The owning Buyer's key is the shadow property BuyerId.</comment>
